# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sequences — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your real values.
# `.env` is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OpenAI API key — used to analyse which muscle groups each pose targets.
# Get one at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY WARNING
# Any variable prefixed with VITE_ is bundled into the client-side
# JavaScript and is therefore VISIBLE to anyone who opens the app in a
# browser and inspects network traffic or the bundle. This is acceptable
# for local development and personal testing ONLY.
#
# For any real/public deployment you MUST move the OpenAI call behind a
# small backend proxy (a serverless function is enough) so the key stays
# on the server. See docs/OPENAI_INTEGRATION.md for the recommended
# production architecture. The code is structured so only one file
# (src/muscleAnalysis.ts) needs to change to swap to a proxy.
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# Optional: which model to use for muscle analysis. Defaults to gpt-4o-mini.
VITE_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Optional: set to "false" to disable muscle analysis entirely (no API calls).
VITE_ENABLE_MUSCLE_ANALYSIS=true
